Sharp 未安装时旁路 03 组；安装后恢复。0.5 缩放表示 4x 超分后再降到 2x 输出。\n6. 基础图满意后，打开 04 组：加载生成图，在 MaskEditor 涂抹折叠关节或底座主板，再运行。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "READ ME / 使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#10283c", "size": [1280, 245], "pos": [30, 30], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#8a5b20", "widgets_values": ["模型匹配提醒\n\n· control_v11p_sd15_scribble.pth 只适配 SD1.5 / SD1.5 微调模型。\n· 若改用 SDXL（例如 Juggernaut XL），请换成 SDXL Scribble ControlNet，不能混用本节点。\n· Product Design LoRA 是可选项；先放置到 models/loras，选择文件名后再取消旁路。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Model compatibility", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3a2812", "size": [500, 220], "pos": [1410, 950], "id": 31, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#7a4d8f", "widgets_values": ["局部重绘区默认“旁路”\n\n在 Load Image 节点右键打开 MaskEditor，把关节、铰链或底座主板涂白（ComfyUI Mask 输出通常以白色为选中区域）。\n建议 denoise 0.45-0.60；过高会改外形，过低只会轻微锐化。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Inpainting workflow", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#32203b", "size": [820, 180], "pos": [420, 1510], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#4b6b2a", "widgets_values": ["4x-UltraSharp\n\n将 4x-UltraSharp.pth 放入 ComfyUI/models/upscale_models。\n若只想快速迭代，可先旁路本组；精修后再恢复并输出最终图。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Upscale note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#223018", "size": [720, 170], "pos": [3040, 980], "id": 33, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [350, 470], "pos": [30, 370], "widgets_values": ["dd445b08799a1039afafe77bc